{"synopsis":"Lee Do-hyeok kembali ke masa lalu untuk menyelamatkan dunia. Ia disuruh mempersiapkan diri sebaik mungkin.\n\nNamun… dunia tidak kiamat. Kini yang tersisa bagi Do-hyeok hanyalah segunung utang.\n\n“Aku akan membayarmu gaji, jadi bantu aku dengan streaming game-ku!”\n\n… Maka, ia pun mulai melakukan streaming game. Namun, entah mengapa, itu terlalu mudah?\n\nSaksikan debut mantan pahlawan sebagai streamer game!","alternative_title":"회귀했는데 세상이 안 망함","author":"Son Byeong-jun (손병준), Seonwoo (선우)","artist":"NemGa (넴가)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"ea7534e0-96ca-48b5-8744-fc501922fb77","number":"63","chapter":"63","title":"","date":"2026-05-11","released":"2026-05-11","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eaf2fda4-8130-4597-891e-0ebc9570e01a/chapter_ch_63/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"96b9596f-b4c5-463d-b319-a21f77af2bb0","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2026-05-11","released":"20